{"id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-tc.md","title":"传递闭包 TC","display":"df-tc — 传递闭包 TC","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-tc","aliases":["29-df-tc"],"display":"df-tc — 传递闭包 TC","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-assignment]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-formula]]"],"source_locator":"§9.2, p.143, DjVu scan 158","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-tc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-tc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tc — 传递闭包 TC"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§9.2, p.143, DjVu scan 158"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq V^2\">\\(E\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in V\">\\(u,v\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x,\\bar y\">\\(\\bar x,\\bar y\\)</span> 为各自无重复且彼此不交的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元变量组。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)\\)</span>；语法、赋值和满足分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac5c4072279f0088\" href=\"?note=ac5c4072279f0088\" title=\"29-df-assignment\">29-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar z\">\\(\\bar z\\)</span> 枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x,\\bar y\">\\(\\bar x,\\bar y\\)</span> 内的自由变量；其值保持为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta(\\bar z)\">\\(\\beta(\\bar z)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}_V(E)\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in V^2\\mid\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(a_i)_{i=0}^{m}\\in V^{m+1}\\;(a_0=u\\land a_m=v\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(a_i,a_{i+1})\\in E)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TC}_V(E)\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in V^2\\mid\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(a_i)_{i=0}^{m}\\in V^{m+1}\\;(a_0=u\\land a_m=v\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(a_i,a_{i+1})\\in E)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\in(|A|^k)^2\\mid A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\in(|A|^k)^2\\mid A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{TC}_{|A|^k}(E_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y,\\varphi}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TC}_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{TC}_{|A|^k}(E_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y,\\varphi}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §9.2，印刷页 143，扫描页 158，明确采用反身传递闭包；本次把旧式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\geq1\">\\(m\\geq1\\)</span> 修正为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。因此空边关系的闭包仍含对角线。关系级定义使嵌套 TC 的语义不再误用仅对 FO 定义的满足关系。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau$，$A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$；语法、赋值和满足分别见 [[29-df-formula]]、[[29-df-assignment]]、[[29-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ac5c4072279f0088","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau$，$A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$；语法、赋值和满足分别见 [[29-df-formula]]、[[29-df-assignment]]、[[29-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau$，$A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)$；语法、赋值和满足分别见 [[29-df-formula]]、[[29-df-assignment]]、[[29-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x,\\bar y","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar z","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x,\\bar y","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta(\\bar z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}_V(E)\\coloneqq\\{(u,v)\\in V^2\\mid\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(a_i)_{i=0}^{m}\\in V^{m+1}\\;(a_0=u\\land a_m=v\\land\\forall i<m\\;(a_i,a_{i+1})\\in E)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y,\\varphi}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,\\bar b)\\in(|A|^k)^2\\mid A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[\\bar a/\\bar x,\\bar b/\\bar y]]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{TC}_{|A|^k}(E_{A,\\beta,\\bar x,\\bar y,\\varphi}).","display":true},{"tex":"m\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false}],"bytes":1895,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6b7ef84cd56a90c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$V$ 为有限集合，$E\\subseteq V^2$；$\\operatorname{TC}_V$ 见 [[29-df-tc]]。"},{"id":"98a7b2fe455fde6b","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TC}_V(E)$ 取反身传递闭包，见 [[29-df-tc]]。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-lfp]]、[[29-df-pfp]]、[[29-df-tc]] — LFP、PFP、TC 算子"},{"id":"d20e58bb8f65e2eb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ans}_{D,1}$ 使用 [[29-df-datalog]]；$\\operatorname{TC}_V$ 使用 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。$D_+$、$E^+$ 在下式构造。"},{"id":"ec51b0bd93fa3fdf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TC}_S$ 使用 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。$P_a^K,E_a^K$ 在下式定义；$a$ 可以是复杂状态公式，求值集合不被假定为一阶可定义。"},{"id":"cef4708b7fffcfcb","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$a,b\\in\\mathsf S_k$；$\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)$；$\\mathsf B$ 是 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]] 的派生路径构造。$\\operatorname{TC}_S$ 为 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。"},{"id":"8fb39f8406bbe27f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle E^{(2)}\\rangle$；辅助词汇 $\\rho=\\langle P^{(2)}\\rangle$。输入和同步更新见 [[29-df-dyn-fo]]；$\\operatorname{TC}_{U_n}$ 采用 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-tc]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-140","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-tc]]"}],"outgoing":["4de8e0c8085801f5","ac5c4072279f0088","3ee556c64b16809b","a3fa1d78e657e6a2"]}